        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Capricorn &mdash; 4th (Ultimate) Technique, gained at level 16.</em></p><p><em>The blade Athena gave to a mortal, used at its full extension.</em></p><p>Each creature in the line takes @Damage[16d6[slashing]] damage with a basic Reflex save. A creature that critically fails is <strong>severed</strong>, no save.</p><p>This damage <strong>ignores all Hardness, all resistances, and all immunities to physical damage</strong>, and treats force effects such as <em>wall of force</em> and <em>forcecage</em> as objects with Hardness 0.</p><p>Any structure, wall, or terrain feature in the line is cut cleanly through.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
